          <h2 class="pane__title">Tokyo in a dish</h2>
          <p class="pane__body">
            Tero's team cut a dish to the shape of the land around Tokyo, put an oat flake on each of 36 cities and set the mold down on Tokyo. Light stood in for the sea, the lakes and the mountains, which the mold shuns. Here 34 cities are food, and Tokyo, the biggest, counts seven times.
          </p>

          <div class="compare" role="group" aria-label="Compare networks. Pick one to draw it on the map.">
            <div class="compare__head mono" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span>Cost</span><span>Travel</span><span>Robust</span></div>
