            <button class="chip chip--go" type="button" data-race disabled>Race the mold</button>
            <button class="chip" type="button" data-clear-track>Clear track</button>
            <button class="chip" type="button" data-next-level>Next level <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
          </div>

          <h2 class="pane__title">How to play</h2>
          <ul class="how" role="list">
            <li><b>Track</b>: drag from a town to another. Drag onto a line to branch off it, or into open ground to make a junction.</li>
            <li><b>Erase</b>: tap or scrub over a line or a junction.</li>
            <li>Track can’t cross light, and the total can’t pass the budget, a multiple of the shortest tree.</li>
            <li>A result within 2% (2 points for robust) is a tie. Beat the mold on one score without losing another to win the level.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="pane__note">The mold is Tero’s flow model at I₀ 2, grown on this map until it settles, from the same start every race. Junctions with two lines and dead ends don’t count for robust, but every length you build counts for cost.</p>
        </section>
      </div>
